{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_140","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,180p' CONFIGS.md; sed -n '1,100p' ERRORS.md; sed -n '1,130p' SYMBOLS.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Configuration surface\n\nThe build axes come directly from `Cargo.toml`, top-level `CMakeLists.txt`, and\nthe 24 parameter headers. A valid build selects exactly one backend, one thash\nmode, and one parameter set. This yields 48 combinations.\n\nParameter shapes:\n\n| set | `N` | full height | layers `D` | tree height | FORS height | FORS trees |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| `128s` | 16 | 63 | 7 | 9 | 12 | 14 |\n| `128f` | 16 | 66 | 22 | 3 | 6 | 33 |\n| `192s` | 24 | 63 | 7 | 9 | 14 | 17 |\n| `192f` | 24 | 66 | 22 | 3 | 8 | 33 |\n| `256s` | 32 | 64 | 8 | 8 | 14 | 22 |\n| `256f` | 32 | 68 | 17 | 4 | 9 | 35 |\n\n## Build cross-product\n\nEach row exercises all applicable API-shape rows below under that build.\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [ ] |\n|---|----------------|--------------------------------------------|-----|\n| C001 | all | `blake,simple,128s` | [ ] |\n| C002 | all | `blake,simple,128f` | [ ] |\n| C003 | all | `blake,simple,192s` | [ ] |\n| C004 | all | `blake,simple,192f` | [ ] |\n| C005 | all | `blake,simple,256s` | [ ] |\n| C006 | all | `blake,simple,256f` | [ ] |\n| C007 | all | `blake,robust,128s` | [ ] |\n| C008 | all | `blake,robust,128f` | [ ] |\n| C009 | all | `blake,robust,192s` | [ ] |\n| C010 | all | `blake,robust,192f` | [ ] |\n| C011 | all | `blake,robust,256s` | [ ] |\n| C012 | all | `blake,robust,256f` | [ ] |\n| C013 | all | `haraka,simple,128s` | [ ] |\n| C014 | all | `haraka,simple,128f` | [ ] |\n| C015 | all | `haraka,simple,192s` | [ ] |\n| C016 | all | `haraka,simple,192f` | [ ] |\n| C017 | all | `haraka,simple,256s` | [ ] |\n| C018 | all | `haraka,simple,256f` | [ ] |\n| C019 | all | `haraka,robust,128s` | [ ] |\n| C020 | all | `haraka,robust,128f` | [ ] |\n| C021 | all | `haraka,robust,192s` | [ ] |\n| C022 | all | `haraka,robust,192f` | [ ] |\n| C023 | all | `haraka,robust,256s` | [ ] |\n| C024 | all | `haraka,robust,256f` | [ ] |\n| C025 | all | `sha2,simple,128s` (SHA-256 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C026 | all | `sha2,simple,128f` (SHA-256 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C027 | all | `sha2,simple,192s` (SHA-512 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C028 | all | `sha2,simple,192f` (SHA-512 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C029 | all | `sha2,simple,256s` (SHA-512 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C030 | all | `sha2,simple,256f` (SHA-512 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C031 | all | `sha2,robust,128s` (SHA-256 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C032 | all | `sha2,robust,128f` (SHA-256 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C033 | all | `sha2,robust,192s` (SHA-512 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C034 | all | `sha2,robust,192f` (SHA-512 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C035 | all | `sha2,robust,256s` (SHA-512 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C036 | all | `sha2,robust,256f` (SHA-512 path, 22-byte compressed address) | [ ] |\n| C037 | all | `shake,simple,128s` | [ ] |\n| C038 | all | `shake,simple,128f` | [ ] |\n| C039 | all | `shake,simple,192s` | [ ] |\n| C040 | all | `shake,simple,192f` | [ ] |\n| C041 | all | `shake,simple,256s` | [ ] |\n| C042 | all | `shake,simple,256f` | [ ] |\n| C043 | all | `shake,robust,128s` | [ ] |\n| C044 | all | `shake,robust,128f` | [ ] |\n| C045 | all | `shake,robust,192s` | [ ] |\n| C046 | all | `shake,robust,192f` | [ ] |\n| C047 | all | `shake,robust,256s` | [ ] |\n| C048 | all | `shake,robust,256f` | [ ] |\n\n## Public API and data-shape branches\n\nThese rows are derived from public headers, dynamic exports, and explicit\n`if`/loop branches in the C implementation. Fixed-seed randomized vectors are\nused for each row.\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [ ] |\n|---|----------------|--------------------------------------------|-----|\n| C049 | `crypto_sign_secretkeybytes`, `crypto_sign_publickeybytes`, `crypto_sign_bytes`, `crypto_sign_seedbytes` | constant queries for the selected parameter set | [ ] |\n| C050 | `SPX_ull_to_bytes`, `SPX_u32_to_bytes`, `SPX_bytes_to_ull` | lengths `0,1,4,8`; zero, one, high-bit, and max values; big-endian truncation | [ ] |\n| C051 | all `SPX_set_*_addr` | zero, in-range, and values with nonzero discarded high bytes | [ ] |\n| C052 | `SPX_set_tree_addr` | zero, one, random, and `UINT64_MAX` | [ ] |\n| C053 | `SPX_set_type` | each documented type `0..=6` and arbitrary/out-of-range `uint32_t` values (low-byte storage) | [ ] |\n| C054 | `SPX_copy_subtree_addr`, `SPX_copy_keypair_addr` | random source/destination including bytes outside copied fields | [ ] |\n| C055 | `SPX_chain_lengths` | all-zero, all-`0xff`, alternating, and randomized `N`-byte messages | [ ] |\n| C056 | `SPX_initialize_hash_function` | zero/random public and secret seeds; backend-specific seeded context | [ ] |\n| C057 | `SPX_prf_addr` | randomized context and address | [ ] |\n| C058 | `SPX_gen_message_random` | message lengths `0,1,block-1,block,block+1,many`; SHA2 short/long branch | [ ] |\n| C059 | `SPX_hash_message` | message lengths `0,1,block-boundaries,many`; digest/tree/leaf masking | [ ] |\n| C060 | `SPX_thash` | `inblocks=1` special case | [ ] |\n| C061 | `SPX_thash` | `inblocks=2` tree-node case | [ ] |\n| C062 | `SPX_thash` | `inblocks=SPX_WOTS_LEN` WOTS compression | [ ] |\n| C063 | `SPX_thash` | `inblocks=SPX_FORS_TREES` FORS compression | [ ] |\n| C064 | `SPX_compute_root` | even/odd leaf, nonzero offset, tree heights `1` and selected tree height | [ ] |\n| C065 | `SPX_wots_pk_from_sig` | zero/extreme/random message chain lengths and randomized signature | [ ] |\n| C066 | `SPX_wots_gen_leafx1` | leaf is not signing leaf (benign branch) | [ ] |\n| C067 | `SPX_wots_gen_leafx1` | leaf equals signing